<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ARIZONA MEN'S TOURNAMENT. [CORRECTED 01:10 GMT 10/03]</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ARIZONA MEN'S TOURNAMENT. [CORRECTED 01:10 GMT 10/03]</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Arizona 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects dateline from March 8.)</p>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>$328,000 Arizona Tennis Classic on Saturday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Chris Woodruff (U.S.) 4-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5) 6-2</p>
<p>8-Richey Reneberg (U.S.) beat Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) 6-3 6-3</p>
